label("$x$", (1.3,0,0));
label("$y$", (0,1.3,0));
label("$z$", (0,0,1.3));
[/asy]

The conditions $|x| + |z| \le 1$ and $|y| + |z| \le 1$ lead to similar regions.  Taking their intersection, we obtain the following solid.

